# macOS folder metadata. Committed accidentally by a `git add -A` on 8 Aug 2026;
# ignored here so it cannot be re-added.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?

# Binary responses saved by web fetches during source-checking sessions. On
# 8 Aug 2026 one landed in ~/.claude/projects/ rather than here, so nothing
# needed removing. The pattern is preventive: source-checking against primary
# documents is now routine, PDFs are how regulators publish, and `git add -A`
# would sweep one in. Same reason as .DS_Store above.
webfetch-*
*.pdf.tmp

# Python bytecode. Written on 26 Oct 2026 when ua_orphan_check.py was imported
# as a module, to read inbound-link counts for pages the checker only details
# when they fail. Importing a checker rather than reimplementing its counting is
# the right move; the .pyc it leaves behind is not ours to commit. Same reason
# as the two above: `git add -A` would sweep it in.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
